{"id":"hitze","lemma":"Hitze","pos":"noun","rank":2456,"glosses":["heat"],"ipa":"/ˈhɪt͡sə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/55/De-Hitze.ogg/De-Hitze.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Hitze"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich kann die Hitze nicht ertragen.","en":"I can't take the heat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755293","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to bear"}]},{"text":"Ich bin diese Hitze nicht gewöhnt.","en":"I'm not used to this heat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/761753","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to accustom","l":"gewöhnen"}]},{"text":"Die Hitze ist unerträglich.","en":"The heat is unbearable.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759465","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"unbearable"}]},{"text":"Wie hältst du diese Hitze aus?","en":"How can you stand this heat?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to hold","l":"halten"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Ich konnte vor Hitze nicht schlafen.","en":"I couldn't sleep because of the heat.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to sleep"}]}]}